OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a damp start for some in
OL,6,Fthe Midlands and south Wales, Saturday
OL,7,Fbrings plenty of sunshine for many.
OL,8,FThe northwest of Scotland remains
OL,9,Fwetter, with the odd shower across the
OL,10,Ffar south. Warmest towards the
OL,11,Fsoutheast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain and low cloud linger in
OL,14,Fthe far south. Elsewhere dry, with
OL,15,Fmist and fog developing later in the
OL,16,Fsoutheast. Chilly overnight, with
OL,17,Frural frost possible. Wetter in
OL,18,Fnorthwest Scotland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
