OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FAfter a chilly, locally foggy
OL,6,Fstart, much of England and Wales
OL,7,Fenjoys warm sunny spells. Further
OL,8,Fnorth, cloud, rain and fresh winds
OL,9,Fspread across Scotland, edging into
OL,10,Fnorthern England later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
